## Landing Page Requirements

### Must-Have Sections

1. **Hero Section**
   - Compelling headline (speaks to gym owners)
   - Value proposition (clear, benefit-focused)
   - Primary CTA (Schedule Demo, Start Free Trial, etc.)
   - Hero image/video (professional, relevant)
   - Trust indicators (if available)

2. **Features Section**
   - Key features with icons/illustrations
   - Benefit-focused copy (not feature-focused)
   - Visual hierarchy
   - Mobile-responsive grid

3. **How It Works**
   - Simple, clear steps
   - Visual flow (diagrams, illustrations)
   - Easy to understand

4. **Social Proof**
   - Testimonials (if available)
   - Case studies (if available)
   - Client logos (if available)
   - Stats/metrics (if available)

5. **Pricing/Plans** (if applicable)
   - Clear pricing tiers
   - Feature comparison
   - CTA buttons

6. **FAQ Section**
   - Common questions gym owners ask
   - Clear, helpful answers

7. **Final CTA Section**
   - Strong call-to-action
   - Multiple CTA buttons
   - Contact form or demo scheduling

### Design Principles

**Professional & Modern:**
- Clean, modern design
- Professional color scheme (brand colors if available)
- High-quality images and graphics
- Smooth animations (subtle, not distracting)
- Consistent typography

**Conversion-Optimized:**
- Clear value propositions
- Multiple CTAs (above the fold, mid-page, bottom)
- Trust indicators (security badges, testimonials, stats)
- Easy navigation
- Fast loading times

**Mobile-First:**
- Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- Touch-friendly buttons
- Readable text sizes
- Optimized images for mobile

**Accessibility:**
- WCAG 2.1 AA compliance
- Semantic HTML
- ARIA labels where needed
- Keyboard navigation
- Color contrast ratios

### Performance Targets

- **Lighthouse Score:** 90+ (all categories)
- **First Contentful Paint:** < 1.8s
- **Largest Contentful Paint:** < 2.5s
- **Time to Interactive:** < 3.8s
- **Cumulative Layout Shift:** < 0.1

### SEO Requirements

- **Meta Tags:** Title, description, Open Graph, Twitter Cards
- **Structured Data:** Organization, Product, FAQPage (if applicable)
- **Sitemap:** Auto-generated sitemap.xml
- **robots.txt:** Properly configured
- **Canonical URLs:** Set correctly
- **Alt Text:** All images have descriptive alt text
- **Heading Hierarchy:** Proper H1-H6 structure

### Analytics Setup

- **Google Analytics 4:** Implemented
- **Conversion Events:** Track key actions (form submissions, CTA clicks, demo requests)
- **Page Views:** Track all page views
- **User Behavior:** Track scroll depth, time on page, etc.

